he nine circles:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Area of shaded region} = A_{\\text{square}} - \\text{Total area of circles} = 400 - 25\\pi\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the area of the shaded region is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{400 - 25\\pi}\n\\]",
